Alembic config for the Holzi Postgres + RLS schema (§1 of the SaaS plan).

Online migrations connect via `settings.database_url` (owner role, full DDL).
The app runtime connects via `settings.runtime_database_url` (holzi_app role,
NOBYPASSRLS) — see src/hermes/db.py once Task 10 lands.

Running alembic from a shell requires HERMES_PLATFORM_ADMIN_TOKEN +
HERMES_PLATFORM_ADMIN_EMAIL in the env (alembic/env.py imports
hermes.config, which validates required fields at import time).
